#: f81faafbcabc444c8339bf419c06143d
msgid "For tree crown polygons, **v.2026-09-10** improves on **v.2026-07-03** across the 7 AOIs: mean area-based **F1 rises from 0.824 to 0.849** and **IoU from 0.706 to 0.741**, with gains in both precision (0.818 → 0.839) and recall (0.833 → 0.863). It leads on F1 in 6 of the 7 AOIs and is on par at Balanga (0.876 vs 0.878)."
msgstr ""

